---
layout: base.njk
title: Dogtopia Construction Project | Toronto | Ridgeway Services
description: Explore Ridgeway's Dogtopia construction project, showcasing our commercial construction experience creating purpose-built facilities for pet care and services in Ontario.
projectSlug: dogtopia
projectCategory: Daycare
projectLocation: Toronto, ON
---
<section class="project-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/projects/headers/{{ projectSlug }}-header.jpg');">
  <div class="container-interior project-hero-inner">
    <a class="project-back-link" href="/projects/">
      <span class="project-back-arrow">←</span>
      <span>Back to projects</span>
    </a>
    <div class="project-hero-copy" data-reveal>
      <h1>Dogtopia</h1>
      <div class="project-hero-meta">
        <span>{{ projectCategory }}</span>
        <span class="divider">•</span>
        <span>{{ projectLocation }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gallery-section section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for filename in galleries[projectSlug] %}
        <button class="gallery-item" data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}">
          <img src="/images/projects/{{ projectSlug }}/{{ filename }}" alt="{{ projectSlug }} gallery photo {{ loop.index }}" />
        </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lightbox overlay -->
  <div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
    <button class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Close gallery">&times;</button>
    <button class="lightbox-arrow lightbox-prev" aria-label="Previous photo">&#8249;</button>
    <img class="lightbox-image" src="" alt="" />
    <button class="lightbox-arrow lightbox-next" aria-label="Next photo">&#8250;</button>
    <div class="lightbox-counter"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white-bg project-description" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container container-interior" data-reveal>
    <p>
      Provide a detailed description of the Dogtopia project, including the scope of work, challenges faced, 
      and any unique aspects of the project. Highlight the results achieved and any client testimonials if available.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white-bg project-nav-section" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <div class="project-nav">
      {% if projectNav[projectSlug].prev %}
        <a class="project-nav-link project-nav-prev" href="{{ projectNav[projectSlug].prev.url }}">
          <span class="project-nav-label">Previous</span>
          {# <strong>{{ projectNav[projectSlug].prev.title }}</strong> #}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if projectNav[projectSlug].next %}
        <a class="project-nav-link project-nav-next" href="{{ projectNav[projectSlug].next.url }}">
          <span class="project-nav-label">Next</span>
          {# <strong>{{ projectNav[projectSlug].next.title }}</strong> #}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>